# FabriCAD command script: UX-24 / UX-30 regression. An outward offset of a slot (lines + arcs)
# creates real curves on the clicked side, and Ctrl+Z (UNDO) after it removes only the offset:
# the sketch stays open ("CHECK dof" needs an open sketch).
# Run from an empty directory: fabricad --script tests/scripts/sketch_offset_undo.fcs --offscreen

SKETCH XY
SLOT
PICK 50,50 nosnap
PICK 80,50 nosnap
PICK 55,55 nosnap
CANCEL
CHECK dof == 5
OFFSET
# pick the top line (not at its midpoint, which picks the point), then click 15 mm above it
PICK 60,55 nosnap
PICK 60,70 nosnap
CHECK dof == 15
INFO sketch:Sketch1
UNDO
CHECK dof == 5
CHECK sketches == 1
FINISH
CHECK sketches == 1
